Bind Npc 24432 Zone 1
Quest 475 "[Repeatable Solo] Grell Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Guard] Keife has commissioned you to hunt Grell. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 30 of 4751, 4701 at direction_330

Requires player level >= 56 and player is karus

Rewards
    Give 2500000 experience or 3750000 with premium

direction_330 = location "Grell" about "Grell\n Terrifies anyone who beholds its eyes; attacks terrified enemies with tentacles" found "Karus" at 225 565 in zone 1

On offer
    Say "Long time no see. How have you been? Do you know about a monster named Grell? They look hideous, can see through objects, and they can ascertain objects 10 Km away."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Can you capture that Grell? I'd really like to see them."

On in_progress
    Say "I'd really like to see those Grell monsters..."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_330

On ready
    Say "Hooray... treasure chest here I come!!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. With my seeking your help all the time, at least this time I can give you something in return."
